{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261SEtzK3Fj21793593024.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超在金融科技周活動上指，作為全球最自由經濟體，投資者正繼續將資金投放本港。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超說︰「香港繼續被確認為全球最自由經濟體，我們是亞洲領先國際金融中心，擁有逾1,400間金融科技公司。我們也晉升至全球競爭力第二位，投資者有信心繼續把資金投放香港，這個全球最大跨境財富管理樞紐。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:13.550739+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T03:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T21:03:04.500806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:05.536136+00:00","content_hash":"26ea86119bf3aa054fc56fa6b9634ac1a51d3d1e629439de18a58d6e1bb5725c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:13.550739+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}